SebType's own code, under the MIT licence in ../LICENSE-SebType, except:
- mozc/: SebType's Mozc (Mozc with fcitx/mozc's Fcitx 5 frontend and SebType's changes), under Mozc's licence
  (BSD-3-Clause, Google; each folder's LICENSE, and the licences of the data in src/data/).
- linux/mozc-keymap.tsv: Mozc's src/data/keymap/ms-ime.tsv with SebType's keys added, under Mozc's licence (BSD-3-Clause).
- weasel/: SebType's Weasel (Weasel with SebType's changes), under Weasel's licence (GPL-3.0, weasel/LICENSE.txt);
  the third-party programs in weasel/output/ keep their own (7-Zip, curl, WinSparkle).
- librime/: SebType's librime (librime with SebType's changes), under librime's licence (BSD-3-Clause,
  librime/LICENSE).
- fcitx5-rime/: SebType's fcitx5-rime (fcitx5-rime with SebType's changes), under fcitx5-rime's licence
  (LGPL-2.1-or-later, fcitx5-rime/LICENSES/).
- linux/mozc/fcitx5-mozc.spec, linux/rime/librime.spec and linux/rime/fcitx5-rime.spec: Fedora's specs with
  SebType's changes, under Fedora's licence for spec files (MIT).
- icons/: the glyph outlines are from Noto Sans CJK and Nunito, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
